OL,3,AConservatives urge Burnham to rule out
OL,4,Atax rises at Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives are urging Prime
OL,7,FMinister Andy Burnham and Chancellor
OL,8,FJohn Healey to rule out tax rises at
OL,9,Fnext month's Budget.
OL,11,FIn his first major speech as shadow
OL,12,Fchancellor Andrew Griffith said
OL,13,Fbusinesses were "suffering enough" and
OL,14,Fthat rumours of higher taxes were
OL,15,F"causing Britain's wealth creators to
OL,16,Fflee the country".
OL,18,FHe also promised to replace tax rules
OL,19,Ffor self-employed workers, who he said
OL,20,Fhad been "badly let down" by the
OL,21,Fsystem.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
